-- title:
--   Vélu c₄ is a non-unit for formal-group p-torsion
-- statement:
--   Let $W$ be a Weierstrass curve over $\mathbb{Z}$ with $\Delta(W) \neq 0$, and let $q$ be a prime with $q \mid \Delta(W)$ and $q \nmid c_4(W)$. Let $A$ be a valuation subring of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}} =$ `AlgebraicClosure ℚ` satisfying `A.LiesOverPrime q`, that is, the image of $q$ in $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ is a non-unit of $A$. Let $p$ be a prime with $p \neq 2$, and let $x, y \in \overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ be such that $(x,y)$ is a nonsingular point of the affine model of $W$ base changed along $\mathbb{Z} \to \mathbb{Q}$ and then to $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$; write $Q$ for the corresponding point of the group of points. Assume $Q$ has additive order exactly $p$, and that $x \notin A$. Then the valuation attached to $A$ of $$c_4(W) + 240 \cdot \sum_{P \in S} \bigl(2\,\mathrm{veluGx}(P) - a_1(W)\,\mathrm{veluGy}(P)\bigr)$$ is $< 1$, where $S$ is the finite set of coordinate pairs obtained as the image of $k \mapsto (k \cdot Q)$ for $1 \le k \le \lfloor p/2 \rfloor$, a multiple being sent to its pair of affine coordinates and to $(0,0)$ if it is the point at infinity, and where `W.veluT x y = 2 * W.veluGx x y - W.a₁ * W.veluGy x y` is summed by `veluTSum` over $S$.
--
--   The quantity whose valuation is bounded is the $c_4$-invariant of the Vélu quotient of $W$ by the subgroup generated by $Q$, computed from Vélu's formulae with the summing half-set of $\langle Q \rangle$; the conclusion says that this $c_4$ is a non-unit at $A$, so the quotient model fails to be of multiplicative type there. It is used by [`WeierstrassCurve.inZeroComponentAt_veluCoord_iff_of_multiplicative`](thm.html#WeierstrassCurve.inZeroComponentAt_veluCoord_iff_of_multiplicative) to rule out the case in which the $p$-torsion point generating the kernel lies in the formal group at a prime of multiplicative reduction.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_WeierstrassCurve_valuation_c4_add_veluTSum_lt_one_of_formal_kernel.lean

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_FLTPrelim_GaloisRep
import Definitions.Def_FLTPrelim_Ramification
import Definitions.Def_EllipticCurve_ZeroComponentAt
import Definitions.Def_WeierstrassCurve_Velu
